WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.260
I’m gonna be honest with you guys, I’ve&nbsp;
been putting this video off for almost a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:08.700
year now. Revisiting the worst of Game of&nbsp;
Thrones is always a painful experience to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:12.660
go through and after making my almost&nbsp;
half-hour-long breakdown of season 8,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:17.700
I was broken and drained and did not want to&nbsp;
go back to talking about these episodes. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

